        {
          "text": " Na mmojawapo wa wale wazee akaniambia, Usilie; tazama, Simba aliye wa kabila la Yuda, Shina la Daudi, yeye ameshinda apate kukifungua kile kitabu, na ile mihuri yake saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
